  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Cook fusilli in the boiling water until 'al dente', 12 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people / 2/3 cup for 4 people). Drain fusilli and return to saucepan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159cc4ffa4e28ccb95b0f0-acbf12cb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To saucepan with the cooked pasta, add light cooking cream, Parmesan cheese, garlic & herb seasoning, basil pesto, baby spinach leaves, the reserved pasta water and a pinch of salt and pepper. Stir to combine.\n• Transfer pasta to a baking dish. Top with Cheddar cheese. Bake until cheese is melted and golden, 10-12 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159cc4ffa4e28ccb95b0f0-72ea20bd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While pasta is baking, in a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, snacking tomatoes, roasted almonds, balsamic vinaigrette dressing and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159cc4ffa4e28ccb95b0f0-e72b1e08.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide basil pesto pasta bake between plates.\n• Serve with cherry tomato and roast almond salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159cc4ffa4e28ccb95b0f0-27ed1bf0.jpeg"
    }
  ]
